1
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:19,290
On Wednesday evening, we went to the Town Hall.

2
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:27,320
It was the last day of the year and a large crowd of people had gathered under the Town Hall clock.

3
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:31,520
It would strike twelve in twenty minutes' time.

4
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:37,850
Fifteen minutes passed and then, at five to twelve, the clock stopped.

5
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:40,740
The big minute hand did not move.

6
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:45,140
We waited and waited, but nothing happened.

7
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:47,690
Suddenly someone shouted.

8
00:00:47,690 --> 00:00:50,720
'It's two minutes past twelve!

9
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:53,030
The clock has stopped!'

10
00:00:53,030 --> 00:00:54,700
I looked at my watch.

11
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:56,430
It was true.

12
00:00:56,430 --> 00:01:00,660
The big clock refused to welcome the New Year.

13
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:07,820
At that moment, everybody began to laugh and sing.
